We now switch, in this section, to a description of a simple locality-based UD-MIS approximation heuristic for UD-MIS, inspired from \cite{nieberg2004robust}. We use it to estimate the classical boundary, given
a fixed time budget, of the UD-MIS approximation.
Algorithm \ref{alg:ptas} and Fig.~\ref{fig:apx_explain} describe its operation.

